---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/index.css';

const featureCards = [
	{
		title: 'Project Videos',
		description:
			'Follow practical builds, reviews and workshop experiments covering PCs, electronics and maker projects.',
		cta: 'Watch videos',
		href: 'https://www.youtube.com/@KingTechNL'
	},
	{
		title: 'Technical Blogs',
		description:
			'Read approachable write-ups, how-to content and engineering notes on hardware and software topics.',
		cta: 'Read blogs',
		href: '/blogs'
	},
	{
		title: 'About KingTech',
		description:
			'Explore the mission behind KingTech: sharing knowledge, testing new ideas and helping others build confidently.',
		cta: 'About us',
		href: '/aboutus'
	}
];

const highlightStats = [
	{ value: '10+', label: 'years exploring technology' },
	{ value: '3', label: 'core focus areas: hardware, software, maker culture' },
	{ value: '100%', label: 'hands-on, experiment-driven learning' }
];
---

<Layout
	title="KingTech | Discover, Build, Share"
	description="KingTech shares practical tech knowledge through videos, blogs and hands-on project stories."
>
	<div class="page-shell">


		<main>
			
			<section class="intro-block intro-accent-card">
				<div>
					<p class="section-label">What KingTech is about</p>
					<h2>Technology is better when it is explained clearly and shared openly.</h2>
				</div>
				<p>
					Technology plays a role in almost every aspect of our daily lives and in every organization
					anywhere in the world. At KingTech, we like discovering the latest and greatest when it comes
					to these technologies. Our projects explore a wide reach of subjects. Whether it is 3D printing,
					industrial electronics, software or customized PC's. KingTech has seen it all. We not only have
					a deep understanding of technology, but firmly believe in spreading that knowledge. Via blogs
					and video's we take our audience on a journey through the latest developments and encourage
					people to experiment and discover. The KingTech philosophy is to enable the tech community with
					the knowledge and tools to develop wonderful projects.
				</p>
			</section>

			<div class="media-card-grid">
				<article class="media-card">
					<img src="/videocreation.png" alt="KingTech YouTube" />
					<div class="media-card-body">
						<p>On our Youtube channel you can find our latest projects and tech reviews. Interested in building a PC? Server? or upgrading an old XBox? We show you how its done!</p>
						<a class="primary-button" href="/videos">Videos</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="media-card">
					<img src="/blogging.jpg" alt="KingTech Blogs" />
					<div class="media-card-body">
						<p>With over a decade of experience with tech, KingTech explores the latest and greatest in both hardware and software. In our blogs we show you what we are working on and provide you with the necessary instructions to do things yourself.</p>
						<a class="primary-button" href="/blogs">Blogs</a>
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>

		</main>

	</div>
</Layout>